description:
Responsibilities will include but not be limited to:
* Adjudicate and process employee benefit claims by each client’s policies and guidelines; raise clarifications when necessary;
* Plan and organize the processing schedule to ensure timely;
* Prepare and deliver claims reports according to clients’ schedules;
* Support in managing inquiries from clients or their employees;
* Participate in new system release testing;
* Support in issue investigation and resolution raised by clients or employees;
* Document and maintain work procedures.

requirements_text:
* University or college graduate, majoring in Chinese or Certificate;
* Chinese - advanced, English - Intermediate;
* A team player, able to work under pressure, plan and organize well;
* Computer literacy;
* Strong attention to detail with a quality mindset;
* Proficient in Microsoft Excel.
